# Trillion-Parameter LLM — WebGPU Inference

This page runs the Naso trillion-parameter MoE transformer model using WebGPU compute shaders.

- **1.0T parameters** stored as 8-bit quantized `quint8`
- **Paged KV cache**: 8 pages max, 2MB/page — long-context within hundreds of MB
- **64 experts × 32 layers** with top-2 MoE routing
- **Server** (port 8765) handles weight paging and quantized matmul dispatch
- **WebGPU** executes WGSL compute kernels for attention scoring

<script type="module">
  // Check for WebGPU support
  if (!navigator.gpu) {
    document.getElementById('gpu-warning').style.display = 'block';
  }

  // Fetch model info
  fetch('http://127.0.0.1:8765/info')
    .then(r => r.json())
    .then(info => {
      const el = document.getElementById('model-info');
      if (el) {
        el.innerHTML = `
          <p><strong>Parameters:</strong> ${info.total_params_str}</p>
          <p><strong>Experts:</strong> ${info.experts} per layer, ${info.layers} layers</p>
          <p><strong>Storage:</strong> ${info.storage_mb.toFixed(0)} MB (8-bit quantized)</p>
          <p><strong>Active/Token:</strong> ${(info.active_params_per_token/1e6).toFixed(1)}M params</p>
        `;
      }
    })
    .catch(() => {
      document.getElementById('model-info').innerHTML = '<p>Server not running. Start with: python3 host_server/src/model_server.py 8765</p>';
    });
</script>

<div id="gpu-warning" style="display:none; background:#3a1a1a; padding:12px; border-radius:8px; margin:16px 0;">
